This product includes software derived from bitwarden-vault-cleanup
(https://github.com/no84by/bitwarden-vault-cleanup), Copyright (c) 2025 no84by,
licensed under the MIT License. The deduplication algorithm (URI normalization,
content fingerprinting, group-by-(uri,username,password), and best-entry
scoring) in src/bw_vault_tools/identity.py originates there.

The Google Authenticator export decoder (src/bw_vault_tools/totp_source.py)
parses the `otpauth-migration` payload, which is Google Authenticator's
`MigrationPayload` protobuf (https://github.com/google/google-authenticator-android,
Apache License 2.0). The field layout follows the community reverse-engineering of
that format, notably Alexander Bakker's writeup "Decoding the Google Authenticator
export QR code". QR-image decoding is provided at runtime by zbar
(https://github.com/mchehab/zbar, LGPL-2.1) via the pyzbar binding
(https://github.com/NaturalHistoryMuseum/pyzbar, MIT) or the zbarimg CLI — these are
optional, separately-installed dependencies, not bundled or modified here.
